{
  "format": 1,
  "about": "Tables test set (phase 0, scripts/tables.js). Each request asks to keep track of something; its table lists the columns a right table needs, in order: the names it may have (any form of them), the kinds that are right (type) and those that also work (also), and a status's or select's steps. Other columns are fine; a grid of pupils by week, a box for each week, is a right homework table too, and a date handed in works as a box does. Every other file holds the same requests in its language, with its own names for each column and step, in the same order; the kinds come from here.",
